Almost all works in RC
task choose the retrieval-based method. Some of them use
two independently position classiﬁers (Chen et al. 2017;
Weissenborn, Wiese, and Seiffe 2017), the others use the
pointer networks (Wang and Jiang 2016; Seo et al. 2016;
Wang et al. 2017; Pan et al. 2017).

